extract, or transfer knowledge of the Licensed Materials into model weights
or a reusable training corpus.

5.2 This restriction includes collecting or repackaging the Licensed Materials
into datasets, embeddings, code corpora, synthetic training sets, or other
materials intended for model training, fine-tuning, distillation, or model
improvement. It also applies to third parties acting on Your behalf.

5.3 Ordinary AI-assisted software development, code explanation, debugging,
review, and task assistance are permitted for Non-Commercial purposes only
when the AI provider and selected settings do not use submitted Licensed
Materials to train or improve models. This limited exception does not permit
bulk ingestion or the creation of a training corpus.

